# integration_tests/ used to hold personal scripts with hard-coded local paths
# and was ignored wholesale. AGENTS.md meanwhile documents `pytest
# integration_tests/` as a required test root, so the root silently did not
# exist — CI collected zero tests there. It is tracked again as of 0.5.4 and
# now holds portable end-to-end tests that resolve paths relative to the repo.
# Keep anything machine-specific out of it, or ignore that file by name here.

